idth=624 height=120 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885000/extras/bc9977269fe74c01266fa6e300149cae.avif?t=1769692304\" width=624 height=120 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885000/extras/6bc518347dc28e6b6293da7e5379fceb.avif?t=1769692304\" width=624 height=121 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885000/extras/53694ff044bb7a593fe57f5b17d97e21.avif?t=1769692304\" width=624 height=121 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885000/extras/ba1346261f5c6b93ee27db307adad871.avif?t=1769692304\" width=624 height=120 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885000/extras/432851c442a7df4cd713921d527d2856.avif?t=1769692304\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885000/extras_big/432851c442a7df4cd713921d527d2856.avif?t=1769692304 width=800 height=154 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A FREESTYLE-DANCE RHYTHM GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the music move you as you catch notes, ride the rails, and dodge obstacles in a unique combination of freestyle dancing and fitness workout that’ll allow you to burn calories while having tons of fun at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOM SONGS</strong> officially supported - create your own beatmaps using the free editor today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BURN CALORIES</strong> in a unique combination of freestyle dance &amp; fitness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MUSIC FOR EVERYONE</strong> with over 80 free songs and 102 optional paid DLC tracks feat. Lady Gaga, Gorillaz, Bruno Mars, Queen, Lindsey Stirling, Muse and more... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet 10 friends in cross-platform Multiplayer</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way with huge variety of gameplay modifiers &amp; styles including Spin &amp; Spiral</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredibly customizable player experience with many great features out of the box including &quot;custom songs&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885000/extras/02910c50e62c5cbdd80b59e5352851ce.poster.avif?t=1769692304\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885000/extras/02910c50e62c5cbdd80b59e5352851ce.webm?t=1769692304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885000/extras/02910c50e62c5cbdd80b59e5352851ce.mp4?t=1769692304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A FREESTYLE-DANCE RHYTHM GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the music move you as you catch notes, ride the rails, and dodge obstacles in a unique combination of freestyle dancing and fitness workout that’ll allow you to burn calories while having tons of fun at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOM SONGS</strong> officially supported - create your own beatmaps using the free editor today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BURN CALORIES</strong> in a unique combination of freestyle dance &amp; fitness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MUSIC FOR EVERYONE</strong> with over 80 free songs and 102 optional paid DLC tracks feat. Lady Gaga, Gorillaz, Bruno Mars, Queen, Lindsey Stirling, Muse and more... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet 10 friends in cross-platform Multiplayer</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way with huge variety of gameplay modifiers &amp; styles including Spin &amp; Spiral</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredibly customizable player experience with many great features out of the box including &quot;custom songs&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885000/extras/02910c50e62c5cbdd80b59e5352851ce.poster.avif?t=1769692304\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885000/extras/02910c50e62c5cbdd80b59e5352851ce.webm?t=1769692304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/885000/extras/02910c50e62c5cbdd80b59e5352851ce.mp4?t=1769692304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
